 ],
 "notes": "Each lifecycle-rule check reads one rule: the regex starts at its rulePriority and may cross at most one closing brace, so a value in the other rule or in a description cannot satisfy it. Assumes rulePriority is written before selection inside the rule (always true of the planned, key-sorted JSON). lifecycle_attached accepts a reference or a literal repository name equal to the repository's name."
